      "id": "claim_80104bb885984defabfeb3cce556e5e0",
      "statement": "generate_assessment and generate_practice_question both require the target module's course to be is_active with status in ('approved', 'archived'), and both call check_enrollment(db, user, course) without bypass_for_owner, so the enrollment check applies uniformly to students, the course owner, and superadmins.",
