    {
      "id": "claim_d86454d8ae1c4f0fad49e51421c70995",
      "statement": "reply_to_ticket may only be performed by the course owner or a user with role guarantor or superadmin, explicitly excludes the ticket's own author even if they are the course owner, sets status to resolved unconditionally on success, and rejects with HTTP 409 if the ticket already has a reply (a ticket can be replied to at most once).",
