    {
      "id": "claim_a9352ddd4d374484832acafa0f62d1c2",
      "statement": "get_tickets restricts users with role UserRole.user to seeing only their own tickets for a course, while course owners, guarantors, and superadmins (implicitly, via reply_to_ticket's authorization and the lack of a user-role filter for them) see all tickets for that course; delete_ticket lets a superadmin always soft-delete a ticket, lets the ticket's own author delete it only while reply is still null, and rejects anyone else with HTTP 403.",
      "evidence": [
