    {
      "id": "claim_1d39b04827114aef867c95a94a01bed9",
      "statement": "Model and prompt for each of the five LLM-driven steps (assessment_generator, assessment_evaluator, practice_generator_open, practice_generator_closed, practice_answer_evaluator) are resolved at runtime via get_llm_config looking up a SystemSetting row by key, falling back to hardcoded DEFAULT_MODEL/DEFAULT_PROMPT constants in the node module when no active row exists; create_chat_llm selects ChatOpenAI vs. ChatAnthropic based on a 'claude' model-name prefix and applies Anthropic-specific handling that omits unsupported temperature and always sets an explicit max_tokens to avoid response truncation.",
