    {
      "id": "claim_9146feca33d54304b5cf6f0a769ba93e",
      "statement": "Module.max_task_attempts (default 3, admin-configurable 1-20) and Module.passing_score (default 75) are per-module settings enforced twice for the assessment flow: once in the evaluate_assessment router as a pre-check gate before invoking the evaluator, and again inside assessment_evaluator's own nodes (load_context reads passing_score, evaluate_answer recomputes is_passed from it, persist_result recomputes the attempt cap from max_task_attempts).",
